    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n**DNG 3D VIRTUAL TOUR OF THIS PROPERTY AVAILABLE**\n\nDelightful and much loved, three bedroomed, semi-detached dormer style residence circa 123 sq.m. 1,324 sq.ft. including garage, with lounge/dining room, television room, kitchen. \n\nLocated in an extremely popular area, between Anne Devlin Road & Marian Road, this property is close to Rathfarnham Shopping Centre and Village, within walking distance to an excellent selection of local shops including, Super-Valu, Get Fresh, Butchers, and Café, at Marian Road and beside Community Centre and Library. \n\nThe area is surrounded by a wide range of amenities, sports and golf clubs, including Ballyboden St Enda's GAA club and Bushy Park. Public transport routes 15B, 74 & S6 and is also just a short drive to the M50 with access to all major routes. Excellent schools including St Patrick's N.S. & Sancta Maria & Colaiste Eanna Colleges are a mere stroll away. There are walled sunny rear gardens. Carpets, blinds, & drapes are included."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGROUND FLOOR - \n\n\nEntrance Porch - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - \n\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.3m x 3.0m\nWith storage units\n\nLounge/Dining Room - 3.83m x 6.4m\n\n\nFamily Room - 4.3m x 3.2m\nWith marble fireplace & hearth and understairs storage\n\nKitchen - 4.1m x 3.1m\nLarge selection of fitted presses, tiled floor including cooker, fridge/freezer & washing machine\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nLanding - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.2m x 3.6m\nLarge selection of built in wardrobe\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.9m x 3.3m\nWith built in wardrobe and access to attic\n\nBathroom - 3.2m x 1.7m\nwith w.c. & w.h.b. newly fitted with walk in shower, fully tiled floor and walls\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Double Glazed Windows</li><li> Oil Fired Central Heating</li><li> Re-Wired 2011</li><li> Burglar Alarm</li><li> Off Street Parking</li><li> Garage 4.5m x 2.2</li><li> Side Entrance</li><li> Outside w.c. & Boiler House</li><li> Outside Tap</li><li> Telephone and Cable T.V. available.</li><li> Carpets, Drapes & Blinds</li><li> Mature Sunny Walled Rear Garden circa 30ft.</li><li> Floor Area 123 sq.m. 1,324 sq.ft. (including garage)</ul>"
      },
